	(text "QSPI boot flash (ZYNQ_PCB_NOTES.md §4.3): U801 IS25WP128-RHLE, 1.8 V, on QSPI0 = MIO1-6 (bank 500).\nBoot straps on IO0-3/SCLK are on sheet 6 (20 k). CS# pull-up R801; RESET# on ps_por_n (supervisor, sheet 4).\nLayout (UG933 QSPI): IO0-3 and CS# matched to SCLK within +/-50 ps; MIO8 (feedback clock) stays a short stub."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
